"date":"2021-10-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29#:~:text=%22You%20can%20call%20me%20Eloise%2C%22%20she%20says","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Edge of the World\" by Aysha U. Farah. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"edge-world-2021-10-29-e3","summary":"Eloise tells Jacob about a vacant tower and a necro-alchemist's misfired geistbomb.","participants":["eloise-wicker","jacob-hauken","geistbomb"],"location":"selhoff","importance":"minor","page":"stories/edge-world-2021-10-29","order":436,"story_date":"2021-10-29","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":43,"quote":"A geistbomb misfired. Killed a bunch of people.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29#:~:text=A%20geistbomb%20misfired.%20Killed%20a%20bunch%20of%20people.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Edge of the World","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Aysha U. Farah"],"date":"2021-10-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29#:~:text=A%20geistbomb%20misfired.%20Killed%20a%20bunch%20of%20people.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Edge of the World\" by Aysha U. Farah. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"edge-world-2021-10-29-e4","summary":"A swarm of geists forms into a screaming woman who throws Eloise against a wall until Jacob banishes her.","participants":["jacob-hauken","eloise-wicker","millicent"],"location":"selhoff","importance":"major","page":"stories/edge-world-2021-10-29","order":436,"story_date":"2021-10-29","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":58,"quote":"The gale slams into Eloise, knocking her backward against the alley wall.","link":"https://mag